	<section_number>3.2-1909</section_number>
	<catch_line>Falsification of records; misdemeanor</catch_line>
	<text>
		It is a Class 1 misdemeanor:
		<section prefix="1">For any processor knowingly to report falsely to the Tax Commissioner the quantity of peanuts subject to tax bought by him during any period.
		</section>
		<section prefix="2">For any processor to falsify the records of the peanuts subject to tax bought by him.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 3-525.18; 1966, c. 702, § 3.1-664; 2008, c. 860.</history>
</law>
